  "description": "In a combo, every hit deals its listed damage, except that every third hit in a row (the 3rd, 6th, 9th, ...) is a critical hit and deals double damage.\n\nA hit of `0` is a miss: it deals nothing and resets the combo, so the count of hits in a row starts again from the next hit.\n\nReturn the total damage.",
